# Tiff AI Mobile 📱  

Cross-platform mobile app for Tiff AI.  
Gives users and vendors access to AI-powered commerce tools on the go.  

## ✨ Features  
- 🛒 AI shopping assistant on mobile  
- 🔔 Push notifications for deals  
- 📊 Vendor insights dashboard  
- 🌍 Offline-friendly (low data mode)  

## 🛠 Tech Stack  
- React Native / Flutter  
- Firebase for notifications  
- Backend: [Tiff AI Core](https://github.com/castro901-art/tiff-ai-core)  

## 🚀 Getting Started  

```bash
git clone https://github.com/castro901-art/tiff-ai-mobile.git
npm install
npm run android   # for Android
npm run ios       # for iOS
